From 81f46e34c0b9c90e074727b151e56370ca2cb187 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ObliviOS Build <build@localhost>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 19:31:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] oblivios: the duress finger link, the decoy administration
 and the hold on the decoy's boot and warm start

Squash of former patches:

- 0008 oblivios: let one enrolled finger open the Duress Unlock decoy
- 0009 oblivios: a failure restoring the duress finger link never fails the owner's unlock
- 0010 oblivios: a match of the duress finger does not reset the real user's fingerprint lockout
- 0011 oblivios: removing the linked finger ends the duress finger link
- 0012 oblivios: choosing the duress finger works for every biometric id
- 0013 oblivios: the decoy administration accepts only the owner's own credential
- 0014 oblivios: hold back BOOT_COMPLETED of a background Duress decoy
- 0015 oblivios: stop the warm decoy at every unlock, unlock it before a switch
- 0016 oblivios: keep the decoy user type in sorted order in system-current.txt
